title: Raritan PX-2000 Family: PDU Inlet Sensor State
agents: snmp
catalog: hw/environment/raritan
license: GPLv2
distribution: check_mk
description:
 This check monitors the state of the inlet sensors of the Raritan PX-2000
 family of intelligent rack power distribution units (iPDUs).
 The check displays the measured value of the sensor.

item:
 The inletLabel, {{Phase}} and the actual inletPoleLine, for example
 {{I1 Phase L1}} or {{I1 Phase N}}. Line names are L1, L2, L3, N, DC+ and DC-.
 Missing labels use {{Inlet <ID>}}; missing line assignments use {{Pole <index>}}.
 Multiple PDUs include the PDU ID. Duplicate labels or line assignments include
 additional indices so distinct sensors cannot overwrite each other.

discovery:
 One service is created for each inlet pole with supported electrical measurements.
 Inlet and outlet measurements are discovered independently.
